<#ff6a78>HAKUREI BORDER</>
Border		^X
  Throws up a border that blocks and reflects
  projectiles. Can be used in a combo to extend it.
EX Border (half a bar)		_D_DB_B^X

<#ff6a78>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves
  her open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second
  cooldown.
Meter Charge (hold)		^B_+^C
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
Super Jump		_D_U

<#ff6a78>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy punch		^A / ^B / ^C
Light / Medium / Heavy kick		_F^A / _F^B / _F^C
  Works standing, crouching (down-forward) and in the air.
Launcher		_D^C
  Hold up on hit to super jump after them and air combo.
  Normals chain into stronger normals.
  Crouching A chains into itself up to 3 times on hit.
Charged Kick (air, hold)		_F^C
  Full charge spikes them into a ground bounce and gives
  one re-jump. Only once per combo: a second one has no
  bounce and they can tech.

<#ff6a78>SPECIALS</>
Hakurei Amulet (charge, ground/air)		[_B]_F^A / ^B
Ascension Kick (charge)		[_D]_U^A / ^B
EX Ascension Kick (half a bar)		[_D]_U^C
Dimensional Rift (teleport)		_B_D_DB^A / ^B
EX Dimensional Rift (half a bar)		_B_D_DB^C
Flying Kick (ground/air)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B
  Air normals that connect can cancel into it.
Wall Jump		_F_D_DF^A / ^B
Bomb		_D_D^A / ^B

<#ff6a78>SUPERS</>
  Any two of A / B / C. With C it is the MAX version.
Fantasy Seal (1 bar, MAX 2)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Barrage (1 bar, MAX 2)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Wind God (1 bar)		_F_DF_D_DB_B_F^A_+^B
Demon Binding Circle (1 bar)		_D_D^A_+^B
Fantasy Heaven (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
Musou Tensei (3 bars)		_D_DF_F_D_DB_B^A_+^B
